ave data in your bigquery data  set let's take a look in the console at  some sample data and how we can run a  quick query to see some aggregate  results  for this example we are looking at a  sample of Google analytics data this  includes things like clicks and events  from users  using table preview we can see a sample  of the data that has been loaded to see  what fields are available and what types  of data populate the fields  next we can run a sample query from the  console to aggregate some user accounts  before we run the query bigquery tells  us the approximate bytes that will be  scanned helping us understand how much  we will be built  once we execute the query we see the  results below and we can get the results  instantly for up to seven days  and there you have it now you know how  to ingest and query data using bigquery  if you're eager to learn more about  Google Cloud marketing analytics check  out the link below  if you enjoyed this video please make  sure to like this video and click the  Subscribe button to watch more videos  like this  [Music]

